==Battleground==
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spam anti-Red Labyrinth fodder and you win.

